aining with progressively higher=E2=80=91quality data annealing, and phase =
5 introduces long=E2=80=91context training, extending the context window to=
 512K tokens. Each phase employs a distinct data mixture and learning=E2=80=
=91rate schedule, gradually shifting from broad web=E2=80=91scale data to m=
ore curated, domain=E2=80=91specific content.</p>
