</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Structured Output</strong></td>
<td>Structured data output</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Text2SQL</strong></td>
<td>Database query generation</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>Temporal Reasoning</strong></td>
<td>Time-based logic and ordering</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>General Chat</strong></td>
<td>General conversational quality</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td><strong>In-context Learning</strong></td>
