<p>During this stage, we trained the models on 45,504 unique prompts (avera=
ged across all Granite=E2=80=AF4.1 models) and found that a learning rate o=
f <code>5e=E2=80=917</code> with a KL=E2=80=91loss coefficient ($\beta$) of=
 <code>0.05</code> performed best for multi=E2=80=91domain reinforcement le=
arning.</p>
