<p>During our RL training, we found that the RLHF stage causes a drop in ma=
th benchmark scores (e.g., in GSM8K, DeepMind-Math). The Math RL stage enab=
les the model to recover from this drop and surpasses the original SFT perf=
ormance on math benchmarks: <strong>~3.8 points</strong> on average for GSM=
