	<span>
		FP8 Quantization
	</span>
</h2>
<p>We also released fp8 quantized variants of the Granite=E2=80=AF4.1 model=
s, optimized for inference with vLLM. The precision is reduced from 16=E2=
=80=91bit to 8=E2=80=91bit, resulting in approximately a 50% reduction in b=
oth disk footprint and GPU memory usage. Quantization is applied only to th=
e weights and activations of linear operators within the transformer blocks=
 using LLM Compressor, while all other layers are preserved at their origin=
al precision.</p>
