	<span>
		Infrastructure
	</span>
</h2>
<p>We trained the Granite 4.1 Language Models on an <strong>NVIDIA GB200 NV=
L72 cluster</strong> hosted on CoreWeave:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Intra-rack communication:</strong> 72-GPU NVLink domain</li>
<li><strong>Inter-rack communication:</strong> Non-blocking, full Fat-Tree =
NDR 400 Gb/s InfiniBand network</li>
<li><strong>Scale:</strong> Thousands of GPUs across the cluster</li>
</ul>
<p>This infrastructure provides the scalable, high-bandwidth interconnect n=
eeded for efficient distributed training at the token volumes required (15T=
+ tokens across pre-training alone).</p>
